+```text
+N=1  K_target=[]        canonical=[]        candidate=[]
+N=8  K_target=[2,2,2]   canonical=[2,2,2]   candidate=[2,2,2]
+N=70 K_target=[2,5,7]   canonical=[2,5,7]   candidate=[2,5,7]
